P4_3321' #212.60   (.group)
  its operations, by index and Seitz symbol   (.operations)
  the orbitals, by Wyckoff position   (.rep.characters)
    4a (32): orbitals 0-7, E
  H symmetrized by 3e-14   (.positions, .symmetrization)

2. the coreps of all 8 bands at the high-symmetry points
bands 0-7 at GM (Γ): GM3 + GM4 + GM5   (.table.bands, .kpname, .counts)
