  multiplets of one class carry the same characters, under any labelling of the orbitals   (.partition)

3. the symmetry data vector of all 8 bands, and of the elementary band representation of E at 4a
all 8 bands:        GM3 + GM4 + GM5 + M1M4 + M2M3 + 2×M5 + R1R2 + R3 + 2×X1 + 2×X2
E↑G(8)@4a(321',32): GM3 + GM4 + GM5 + M1M4 + M2M3 + 2×M5 + R1R2 + R3 + 2×X1 + 2×X2

4. the auxiliary bands: the elementary band representation induced from A1 at either 4a or 4b
A1↑G(4)@4a(321',32): GM1 + GM5 + M1M4 + M5 + R3 + X1 + X2
A1↑G(4)@4b(321',32): GM1 + GM5 + M1M4 + M5 + R3 + X1 + X2

